// breeds, and it refuses an order whose breed is not one of the species sent. Each row maps
// a dmi bird breed ref to the Antech V6 breed it is; an order for that bird then goes out
// with the breed's own Antech species. A dmi bird ref with no row here takes the Avian
// default.
